{"id": "v13b-zimage-to-glb-frontonly", "revision": 0, "last_node_id": 300, "last_link_id": 266, "nodes": [{"id": 1, "type": "Note", "pos": [-2580, -1340], "size": [520, 320], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["# v12 - Z-Image (front+back) -> Hunyuan3D mesh (with vertex colors) -> SkinToken rig -> HYMotion animation\n\nIndependent pipeline; does not modify `pipeline_workflow_v11_front_aligned.json` or `pipeline_workflow_v11.json`.\n\nStages:\n1. Z-Image text-to-image (batch=2, two views): UNETLoader/CLIPLoader/VAELoader -> ModelSamplingAuraFlow -> CLIPTextEncode + ConditioningZeroOut -> EmptySD3LatentImage (1024x1024, batch_size=2) -> KSampler (8 steps, cfg=1, res_multistep) -> VAEDecode.\n   Models required: `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors`, `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`, `ComfyUI/models/vae/ae.safetensors`.\n2. View split: `ImageFromBatch` x2 (`start=0,length=1` for front, `start=1,length=1` for back). `PreviewImage` shows both. The front and back prompts share one positive prompt, so the back is the same character from a different angle - if you need a distinct back-side prompt, split the encode step into two CLIPTextEncode + ConditioningZeroOut and use a different text for the back.\n3. Image prep for Hunyuan3D 2.1: each view -> `ImageResize+` 1024 -> 518x518, then `TransparentBGSession+` + `ImageRemoveBackground+` (per view).\n4. Multiview for vertex colors: `ImageBatch` concatenates front+back into batch=2; this is wired into `VertexToHighPoly.multiview_images` together with the postprocessed trimesh. `VertexToHighPoly` projects both views as vertex colors using its default 2-view camera layout (azimuth 0 / 180, elev 0).\n5. 3D mesh from front: `Hy3DModelLoader` -> `Hy3DGenerateMesh` (single-image) -> `Hy3DVAEDecode` -> `Hy3DPostprocessMesh`. The trimesh feeds into `VertexToHighPoly` for vertex coloring.\n6. Output chain: vertex-colored trimesh -> `Hy3DExportMesh` (writes `3D/Hy3D_zimage_*.glb`) and `Preview3D.model_file`. The same trimesh also goes to `SkinTokenRigTrimesh` -> `TrimeshToMESH` -> `SaveGLB` (rigged lowpoly GLB) and `rigged_path` -> `HYMotionExportFBX.custom_fbx_path`.\n7. Motion: `HYMotionLoadLLMGGUF` + `HYMotionLoadNetwork` + `HYMotionEncodeText` -> `HYMotionGenerate` -> `HYMotionPreview` + `HYMotionExportFBX`."], "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 100, "type": "UNETLoader", "pos": [-2400, -900], "size": [315, 82], "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "UNet名称", "name": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "数据类型", "name": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "模型", "name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [200]}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "widgets_values": ["z_image_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"]}, {"id": 101, "type": "CLIPLoader", "pos": [-2400, -760], "size": [315, 110], "flags": {}, "order": 2, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "CLIP名称", "name": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "类型", "name": "type", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "type"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "设备", "name": "device", "shape": 7, "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "device"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "CLIP", "name": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [201]}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors", "lumina2", "default"]}, {"id": 102, "type": "VAELoader", "pos": [-2400, -600], "size": [315, 60], "flags": {}, "order": 3, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "vae名称", "name": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "V